            </note>
            <note corresp="#d288-f2" n="2" xml:id="d288-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 210998 to Geneva, June 14, instructed the U.S. mission to approach the
                    International Committee of the Red Cross to ask if the ICRC wanted such assistance. (National Archives and Records
                    Administration, RG 59, Central Files 1967–69,
                        POL 27 ARAB–ISR)</p>
            </note>
